      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Copilot is now one connected experience in the cloud.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-work-from-anywhere-with-a-new-connected-copilot-cloud-experience",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:23.015Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Start a cloud task wherever you are, on github.com, GitHub Mobile, the Copilot CLI, the Copilot app, VS Code, or right from a conversation in Slack or Microsoft Teams.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-work-from-anywhere-with-a-new-connected-copilot-cloud-experience",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:23.015Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The new Copilot cloud experience across surfaces (e.g., Web, Mobile, App, CLI, VS Code, Slack, and Microsoft Teams) and cloud sandboxes are both generally available on paid Copilot plans.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-work-from-anywhere-with-a-new-connected-copilot-cloud-experience",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:23.015Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Start cloud sessions and continue your work anywhere",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-work-from-anywhere-with-a-new-connected-copilot-cloud-experience",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:23.015Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Start from anywhere: Kick off a cloud session from github.com, the Copilot CLI, the Copilot app, VS Code, or the redesigned Copilot experience on GitHub Mobile.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-work-from-anywhere-with-a-new-connected-copilot-cloud-experience",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:23.015Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Cloud sessions have the same tools as the Copilot CLI and Copilot app, plus ways to bring in context and customize how Copilot works:",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-work-from-anywhere-with-a-new-connected-copilot-cloud-experience",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:23.015Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Set them up once in the Customize menu on GitHub or in the Copilot app, and they work in every cloud session.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-work-from-anywhere-with-a-new-connected-copilot-cloud-experience",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:23.015Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Access to cloud experiences, including Copilot on github.com and GitHub Mobile, is governed by the policy in Copilot settings titled &ldquo;Copilot in the cloud&rdquo;.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-work-from-anywhere-with-a-new-connected-copilot-cloud-experience",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:23.015Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "If you previously had cloud agent enabled, but opted a repository out of Copilot cloud agent, this repository exclusion will be brought over into the new experience.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-work-from-anywhere-with-a-new-connected-copilot-cloud-experience",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:23.015Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The new Copilot cloud experience is available on paid Copilot plans only and is rolling out to users starting October 28th.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-work-from-anywhere-with-a-new-connected-copilot-cloud-experience",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:23.015Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Copilot Free users can continue to use Copilot Chat on github.com and GitHub Mobile and can get the updated experience by upgrading their Copilot plan.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-work-from-anywhere-with-a-new-connected-copilot-cloud-experience",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
